NOT INVESTMENT ADVICE

This project is a research toolchain for studying Taiwan index futures price
behaviour. Nothing in this repository — including any backtest result,
strategy specification, hypothesis document, or indicator — constitutes
investment advice or a recommendation to trade. Backtested performance is
simulated, does not account for all real-world costs, and is not indicative
of future results. Use at your own risk.

THIRD-PARTY DATA

Market data is retrieved from public sources (TAIFEX, TWSE, TPEX, FinMind and
others) at run time. Two small derived series are checked in under
data/external_sources/, so that the fg-composite work (S004, H085) stays
reproducible without an API key: 0050_TW_adj.csv (adjusted closes for 0050.TW)
and VIXTWN.csv (TAIFEX Taiwan VIX). Everything else — tick archives, daily bars,
breadth, margin and business-cycle series — is fetched at run time and is not
redistributed here. Users are responsible for complying with the providers' terms
of use.

THIRD-PARTY CODE

Backtests run on backtesting.py (https://github.com/kernc/backtesting.py), which
is licensed AGPL-3.0. This repository does not redistribute it; it is installed
from PyPI at setup time, so the combination is formed on the user's machine. If
you redistribute a combined work that bundles backtesting.py, AGPL-3.0 terms
apply to that combination regardless of the MIT licence above.
